{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/8/618cc23422e2734bcf814beb45e8144952708af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x^2+6x-120=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/7/c37b59532acbe935462d8a766955ee9b474b3567.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  x=-10,\\,2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  x=-6,\\,20 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  x=-2,\\,10 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  x=-5,\\,4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  x=-4,\\,5 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"756\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can factor the polynomial:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/9/ab93e16d3f52f077ed72d7bd0dfbcb16c6996179.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x^{2} + 6x - 120 = 6(x^{2} + x - 20) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"292\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/1/ff111d0dfec48564ee3cb89dd97d46626d023e70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + x - 20 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/5/5a55a5bd62605496e4f235550ca319629d648419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 5)(x - 4) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From this, the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy the equation are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/3/133f844318df3a021bd579e19d89af7228f37242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } -5,\\,4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_30\" ti